Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.55,0:00:06.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Target scope, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:07.82,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Target, fixed.{Fix the target.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:10.84,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,All hands, prepare for shock and flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:13.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Electro-reflex sight brightness 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:16.00,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Ten seconds until firing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:18.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.11,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:20.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:21.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:22.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:23.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:23.77,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:28.24,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Domon !
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:33.37,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,I should have done this sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:41.26,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Yamato, what are you doing ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.75,0:01:01.17,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,All hands, prepare for \Nhand-to-hand combat !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.17,0:01:02.51,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,, Don't let the enemy enter the ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:06.08,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Talan...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:08.70,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...prepare to self-destruct...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:13.46,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...although it probably won't be\N enough to sink{destroy} this fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.97,0:01:15.68,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,A...aye, sir !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:22.93,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Kodai, are you going to let me die for nothing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.33,0:01:28.57,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Help, I need your help !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.28,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,I beg you !\N There's a way to save everyone !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.02,0:01:35.71,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Mr. Yabu, I need your help !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.51,0:01:39.08,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,But I can't leave my post now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:40.91,def2,TASUKE,0,0,0,,Ryusuke, don't tell me you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.91,0:01:42.20,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,I have permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.02,0:01:46.15,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,I don't know what he's thinking either !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.64,def2,BANDO,0,0,0,,Miyako, Sakamoto !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.17,0:01:52.33,def2,BANDO,0,0,0,,You too ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:54.17,def2,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,What's going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:56.64,def2,SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,I was about to take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.24,def2,SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,Must be that Ryusuke again...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:01:59.42,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Get in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.48,0:02:01.80,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We're taking off immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.44,0:02:03.80,def2,GUYS,0,0,0,,Captain Kodai ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.26,0:02:15.35,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,So, tell me, why do I have to accompany you in exchange for accepting my plan ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.35,0:02:17.86,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,I pointed a gun at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.86,0:02:19.86,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,"I should have done this sooner."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:23.31,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:25.71,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...but that won't necessarily lead to success.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:29.17,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Reality is complex and cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:33.95,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You'll be hurt less if you accept\N such unreasonable situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:36.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That's one of the correct viewpoints.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.77,0:02:43.37,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,But, even so, we have\N things we can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:46.66,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,If you're told to give up, you must resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.57,0:02:49.04,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Don't worry about your position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:53.93,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Fight every inch of the \Nway so you can be yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.86,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I'd forgotten about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.86,0:02:59.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...for far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.33,0:03:01.48,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Captain Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:05.17,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Let's make up for lost time. \NDon't bite your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:11.11,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I see. \NThat's what Captain Kodai decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.62,0:03:15.40,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I understand.\N I'll get to it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:19.20,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Thank you, Captain Mori, Captain Sanada.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:26.35,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,All ships, come about 180 degrees !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.57,0:03:31.40,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}To all joint fleet ships...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:37.06,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}...the Earth fleet will commence an \Noperation to rescue Führer Desler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:40.51,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Follow us if you so desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.31,0:03:45.60,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}We need your help\N to divert enemy attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:49.20,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Migrant fleet, continue moving \Nand get as far away as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:53.55,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}If you're willing to join, show your\N intent by turning your ships around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:57.71,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,They are the ones who broke the promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:04:01.40,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,You can't complain now, Queen Starsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.11,0:04:06.06,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,They're fighting again ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:08.55,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Abelt...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:13.57,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,Encrypted transmission ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:16.93,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,From the Earth fleet...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.95,0:04:28.02,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Just one pattern...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:56.62,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Open the flight deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.82,0:05:01.26,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Prototype dimensional submarine,\N ready for take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:04.37,def2,SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,"Cosmo Hound" ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.37,0:05:06.75,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,The development team named it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:08.95,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,This is the Earth force's\N first dimensional submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:13.44,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,It's a stupid dog, one prone to \Nfailing once every three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:15.68,def2,SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,Seriously ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:17.02,def2,RAIDEN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:19.40,def2,RAIDEN,0,0,0,, It's a perfect companion for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:22.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Cosmo Hound, take off !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.57,0:05:30.91,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,Emergency dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.13,0:05:51.62,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Dimensional submersion echo detected. \NUnknown wave length.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:06.11,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,What's the situation outside the ship ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.11,0:06:07.84,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The joint fleet is still fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.44,0:06:10.60,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yamato is repeatedly telling us to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.11,0:06:15.04,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,What are you thinking ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:23.46,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:29.64,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,I don’t know how you do things\Non Iscandar, but on Earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:32.75,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...a person who falls in love with an \NEarthling's sibling becomes{\i1} family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:39.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You loved my brother, \Nwhich makes you my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,, Nothing else matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:44.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I want you to come to Earth with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:46.71,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:49.91,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...don't want to lose my family again !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:57.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Sister !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:07.26,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,If you don't leave, \NFührer Desler won't withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:14.46,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,It might sound foolish. \NWe humans are foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:20.13,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,We act irrationally for the \Nsake of important things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:26.26,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Starsha, if you are human,\N I want you to be foolish !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.22,0:07:30.84,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Throw everything away !\NThen muster the courage to leave this graveyard !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.17,0:07:36.11,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,Let's go, Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:41.35,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,We aren't ghosts who subject ourselves\Nto reliving the past in perpetuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.35,0:07:42.86,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,, We are also "life."{We're alive.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:48.40,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,{yosou}We should live unpredictable\N lives, moving toward the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:50.62,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Yurisha...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:54.97,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,Whether it’s for a minute, or even\Na second, it's of no consequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.97,0:07:58.55,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,If I can live just one genuine, fulfilled life…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:07:59.82,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,...then I want to live it !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:24.37,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It's the same wave length from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:28.31,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Dimensional submersion echo detected\Ndirectly below the Iscandar palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:31.55,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,So that's your aim, is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.28,0:08:34.55,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,Release the net !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.86,0:08:43.20,def2,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,No abnormalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:45.42,def2,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,How do you feel ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.35,0:08:52.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I'm happy with your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:57.33,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,But we can't let them \Nhave Iscandar like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:03.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:05.28,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,Sonar contact. It's getting bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:09.95,def2,TASUKE,0,0,0,,That thing swallowed the \NGarmillas submarine earlier…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:16.08,def2,SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,It's coming ! It's coming !\NIt's closing in !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:22.08,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Everyone, this is the moment of truth. \NBreathe together as if rowing a cutter boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:24.60,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,We're all in this together !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:25.44,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Domon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:29.82,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It's your plan.\N You command this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:32.53,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Aye, sir !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:39.15,def2,TASUKE,0,0,0,,Thrust is unstable !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.15,0:09:41.86,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,I see it !\NDimensional boundary in sight !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:45.06,def2,SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,The enemy is faster than expected !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.42,0:09:48.22,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,We're still good. \NCount down as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.68,0:09:50.82,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,T-minus ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:52.55,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.55,0:09:53.62,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.62,0:09:54.57,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:55.57,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:56.64,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.64,0:09:57.73,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.73,0:09:58.66,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:09:59.60,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,One !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:01.91,def2,GUYS,0,0,0,,Heave-ho !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.53,0:10:04.53,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:06.45,def2,BANDO,0,0,0,,No good ! The lock's stuck !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:08.73,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}It's malfunctioning !\N I've gotta check the circuit !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:10.53,def2,SAKAMOTO,0,0,0,,There's no time for that !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.84,0:10:12.06,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,This stupid dog !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:13.82,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Crap, we'll be captured !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.15,0:10:18.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Sakamoto, down trim.\N Reverse speed 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:28.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Raiden, don't give up !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.06,0:10:31.51,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Only one lock is stuck. \NKeep pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:32.91,def2,RAIDEN,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.91,0:10:35.64,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Is "brave" only in your surname, Caroline ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:40.37,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Tasuke, channel more power !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:43.95,def2,TASUKE,0,0,0,,That's impossible !\N We won't be able to surface !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:46.64,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Once the ship gets lighter, \Nwe'll be able to ! Do it !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:19.40,def2,RAIDEN,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:29.44,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Target captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:35.44,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,We only need the royals to \Nmanage their accursed power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.15,0:11:42.35,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:56.15,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Domon...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.40,0:12:10.17,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Wave motion energy response\N detected inside the enemy ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:12.70,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,It's a trap !\N Get it out of the Golva now !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:14.15,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\frz11.66\pos(730,606)}Exp
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:14.15,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\frz9.544\pos(884,456)}Wave Motion Excavator
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.95,0:12:39.37,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,Your Excellency...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.37,0:12:42.51,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Führer Desler, we've rescued Queen Starsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.71,0:12:46.33,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I suggest that you escape now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:56.97,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Abelt...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.40,0:13:02.35,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Talan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.35,0:13:03.26,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:18.97,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}The records have become distorted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.97,0:13:21.51,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}The thousand-year dream of \NDezariam has become warped.{crooked.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:26.00,def2,MELDERS,0,0,0,,By just one bomb ? How ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:30.13,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Wave motion energy…that accursed power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:36.44,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Mœlders !\N Follow Dezariam doctrine...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:38.68,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}...and sink that accursed ship !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.48,0:13:43.64,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,High energy response \Ndetected in the enemy fortress !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:47.15,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Fan out !\NTell the advanced migrant ships to do the same !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:49.68,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Response getting stronger !\NWe won't make it in time !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:19.00,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Abelt...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:21.95,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Starsha...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:31.22,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,Those eyes… \Nthey've always been fixed on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:38.04,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,I'll never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:40.73,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,, {\fad(0,750)}Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:03.73,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,We're memories of Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.66,0:16:07.08,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,, Since the planet is gone,\N we're destined to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:11.20,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,But this child is different…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.22,0:16:14.22,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,...due to an element unique\N to your kind's planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:17.64,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,Namely, the love shared between Kodai Mamoru \Nand my sister, which gave birth to a life such as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:30.91,def2,YURISIA,0,0,0,,Sasha, make sure to have fun on Earth, okay ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:39.71,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,You knew ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.93,0:16:44.62,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,Why would you… \NIf you knew this'd happen, why ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:47.42,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It saved a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.20,0:16:53.86,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Even for a brief moment, he was able to \Nmeet the person he loved for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.95,0:16:58.66,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That alone can save a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.97,0:17:02.53,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,For the last time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:15.97,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,My father looked at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.00,0:17:24.00,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That's the best one human \Ncan do for another human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:40.08,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,That should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:45.57,def2,DOMON,0,0,0,,That must be enough. \NIt has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:03.88,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Everyone can go onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:07.42,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Don't rush, stay calm and move \Nto the ships you've been assigned to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.26,0:18:19.06,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,So this is Starsha's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:22.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Should I send it to quarantine ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:45.60,def2,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,A baby ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.53,0:18:56.66,def2,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Sasha...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:01.53,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Sasha ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.73,0:19:24.57,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Starsha and my brother's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:47.71,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:52.48,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Hello, Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:05.11,def2,ODDO,0,0,0,,Daddy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:16.24,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Did you know ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:20.26,def2,YABU,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}When you feel the worst, something\N wonderful is right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:36.26,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,This blue blood and skin...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:41.15,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,The people of Garmillas will \Neventually discover our origins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.57,0:20:47.57,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,However, we'll remain \Nproud of the name Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.13,0:20:52.24,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Pride cannot be given.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.24,0:20:54.62,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,You develop it in\N your heart yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:57.62,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Führer Desler...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.62,0:21:02.17,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I appreciate you letting me see Starsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.86,0:21:10.28,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Even if it was just for a moment, I received\N enough to live for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.48,0:21:15.31,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Take care of her child.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:21.55,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Kodai, make sure to never let go...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:23.42,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...of that which you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:31.17,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}In the crumbling world...\N{\i1}koware yuku sekai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.17,0:21:38.28,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}...even fire and hope freeze\N{\i1}hi mo kibou mo kooru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:46.84,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}But only tears are warm\N{\i1}demo namida dakewa atatakai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.42,0:21:56.17,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Behind the sorrow...\N{\i1}kanashimi no ushiro de itsumo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.17,0:22:03.04,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}...happiness always waits for you {next}\N{\i1}tsugi wa shiawase ga matteiru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.04,0:22:14.73,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Let's turn that fairy tale into truth\N{\i1}sonna guuwa wo shinjitsuni kaemashou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:26.48,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}You whisper with a spark in your eye\N{\i1}anata no me ga mabushisouni sasayaku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:43.97,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}You don't dream to get hurt\N{\i1}yume wo miru no wa kizutsuku tame janai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.24,0:22:52.80,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}In the crumbling world...\N{\i1}koware yuku sekai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.80,0:22:59.84,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}...even fire and hope freeze\N{\i1}hi mo kibou mo kooru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.84,0:23:10.08,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}But only tears are warm\N{\i1}demo namida dakewa atatakai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:33.45,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\3c&H000000&\pos(238,1054)}Hello, Sasha
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:33.45,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\3c&H000000&\pos(216,870)}Final Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.91,0:23:36.77,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Those were inside the enemy fortress ?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.77,0:23:41.08,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,We managed to photograph them when\N the wave motion excavator went in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.02,0:23:45.13,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Andromeda-class ?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.84,0:23:48.53,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,They could have been captured...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.53,0:23:50.53,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,I thought that at first, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.28,0:23:57.22,def2,NIIMI,0,0,0,,The numbers indicate that there are far\Nmore vessels out there than we ever built.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.77,0:24:01.02,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Dezariam...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.28,0:24:05.44,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Who are they really ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.28,0:24:13.00,yamato,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fscx208\fscy166\pos(940,238)}Be Forever Yamato
Comment: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:33.60,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx150\fscy120\c&H000000&\move(612,218,618,232,9,4305)}Space Battleship
