Comment: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:25.42,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,song start (dummy)
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{tada hitotsu no inori}There's only one prayer.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{mirai wa mou hajimatte iru}The future has already begun.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{Mayoi tsukareta tamashii wo}The lost and weary souls...
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{Nemuraseru tame no kuchizuke}They can be put to sleep with a kiss.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{Higashi no sora ga moerumade dakishimete}Hold me until the eastern sky burns.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{Watashi tachi wa tamesareteru dareka ni}We're being tested by someone...
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{Ai wa dore hodo hito wo tsuyoku suru no}...how strong can love make you.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{Koware yuku sekai}In the crumbling world...
